00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:11.799
Natasha asks, could you talk a little bit more about how you analyze insurance models to determine

00:11:11.799 --> 00:11:16.919
if they are good? Yeah. So it really depends on the model that you're validating.

00:11:17.479 --> 00:11:24.039
