00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:29.719
around these models. So who owns the parameters? How many times are they updated? Where's the

00:12:29.719 --> 00:12:34.200
source of the data? Have you validate this data? Have you done the right adjustments to the data

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:40.200
in order to model these particular risks? So there's many components on how to do this.

